# sha256 of every file the Kimi-K3.1 true-on-policy patches change (after all patches are applied) and of every
# plugin file. Paths starting with vllm/ are relative to the site-packages directory that holds vllm, experimental/
# to /opt/Megatron-LM, kimi-k31/ to /opt/k31-plugins. docker/rocm/Dockerfile.rocm.kimi-k31.true-on-policy checks
# them at build time (sha256sum -c).
# The comment above each entry is the md5 of that file in the validated runs.
# experimental/ entries: the restructured tree (mLite k1-k31-rocm-min 2e4541c, 5 patches megatron-k31-01..05),
# trainer files validated by gate 6 at a99944b (g6v8_min_a99944b, g6v9_img_refresh_a99944b); 77f745a/2e4541c change only the adapter export (TP slice) and its test.
# vllm/ entries: unchanged from the previous manifest. kimi-k31/ entries: unchanged except k31lora/__init__.py and the new
# k31lora/lora_slice.py (the receive side of the per-rank expert LoRA slice, moved out of verl).

